      "Description": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "3D8B4EC54132FF04BD0881BEA751279B",
        "SourceString": "You meet two villagers on the outskirts of Haerndean, a man and a woman, who want to start fighting back against the bandits, but don’t want to tell the Village Elder in case the Elder forces them to stop. They ask you to craft weapons for them so they can learn how to fight. They also want to observe you fighting a bandit so they can learn your fighting style.",
